  "ingredients": [
    "0.5 cup butter, cubed",
    "8 medium carrots, cut into 1-inch chunks",
    "4 stalks celery, cut into 1-inch chunks",
    "1 cup chopped onion",
    "4.6666665077209 cups water, divided",
    "2 (10.5 ounce) cans condensed beef consommé",
    "2 teaspoons salt",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "3 cups cubed leftover cooked turkey",
    "2 cups frozen cut green beans",
    "0.5 cup all-purpose flour",
    "2 teaspoons Worcestershire sauce",
    "1.5 cups all-purpose flour",
    "2 tablespoons minced fresh parsley",
    "2 teaspoons baking powder",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "0.125 teaspoon poultry seasoning",
    "0.75 cup 2% milk",
    "1 large egg"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a Dutch oven over medium-high heat. Add carrots, celery, and onion and sauté until soft, 5 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UEpmC515wmwEuJfXQulilZMW9wA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/268446-turkey-with-dumplings-soup-VAT-step-01-bf8e660dc6814c849851a2454dc6e4d9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/268446/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add 4 cups water, condensed consommé, salt, and pepper; bring to a boil. Reduce heat to low, cover, and cook until vegetables are tender, 10 to 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ThXdGnUOL4K61SHK2O5fa9UeZjI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/268446-turkey-with-dumplings-soup-VAT-step-02-6953b96174b64c69a09d0451bdbc63c9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/268446/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add turkey and green beans to the Dutch oven; cook for 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qg_-0sSu2pbZ0RrQbAfFyDlKM-E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/268446-turkey-with-dumplings-soup-VAT-step-03-ccd6b0349bc844bb88d355b606daba65.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/268446/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour, remaining 2/3 cup water, and Worcestershire sauce in a small bowl and stir until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/FCZ_q3Ko26xLPRNIWi1MybuG9To=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/268446-turkey-with-dumplings-soup-VAT-step-04-3843ca4d2d56476bbc4dbcbd433be46e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/268446/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir into soup, increase heat, and bring to a boil. Reduce heat, cover, and simmer soup until thickened, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Q0pG9HxuAK6znDFzrnEpWB4VWrQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/268446-turkey-with-dumplings-soup-VAT-step-05-03a1f3561d1e46e59b98dc0c4d807ef4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/268446/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While soup is simmering, make dumplings: Mix flour, parsley, baking powder, salt, and poultry seasoning together in a large bowl. Whisk milk and egg together in a separate bowl. Stir egg mixture into flour mixture, mixing just until batter is moistened.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/76J9CRTnil0IVZcieNXIigzPoGk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/268446-turkey-with-dumplings-soup-VAT-step-06-78cd912aab5e44a187ed681793f1025f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/268446/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drop tablespoons of dumpling batter into simmering soup.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/79V57XYjLR68eM0F0BfB59wKhEg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/268446-turkey-with-dumplings-soup-VAT-step-07-953f0d73413b4ca397b7f101cc9aadb7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/268446/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover and simmer until a toothpick inserted into several dumplings comes out clean, 15 to 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CBBOl34cGav4lqcLBRxyUu0q14U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/268446-turkey-with-dumplings-soup-VAT-step-08-61728191939b44f7834be44e5f48cdaf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/268446/step_08.webp"
